---
import Layer from '../../diagrams/Layer.astro';
---

<figure class="xp-platform-diagram lg:uno-ml-auto lg:uno-max-w-[40rem]" aria-labelledby="platform-layers-title">
  <figcaption class="xp-platform-diagram__header">
    <p class="xp-platform-diagram__eyebrow" id="platform-layers-title">Platform layers</p>
    <span class="xp-platform-diagram__scale" aria-hidden="true">CSS layer model</span>
  </figcaption>

  <div class="xp-platform-stack" aria-describedby="platform-layers-summary">
    <div class="xp-platform-stack__plates">
      <Layer title="Applications" eyebrow="User space" tone="applications" offset="calc(var(--platform-layer-gap) * -1.5)" zIndex={4}>
        <p>Application software sits above platform-owned boundaries instead of defining them.</p>
      </Layer>

      <Layer title="Guest systems" eyebrow="Domains" tone="guests" offset="calc(var(--platform-layer-gap) * -0.5)" zIndex={3}>
        <p>Linux, RTOS workloads, and service domains can keep separate runtime and hardware assumptions.</p>
        <div class="xp-domain-strip" aria-label="Example guest domains">
          <span>
            <i class="xp-domain-icon i-carbon-linux" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            Linux
          </span>
          <span>
            <i class="xp-domain-icon i-carbon-chip" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            RTOS
          </span>
          <span>
            <i class="xp-domain-icon i-carbon-container-services" aria-hidden="true"></i>
            Services
          </span>
        </div>
      </Layer>

      <Layer title="Xen hypervisor" eyebrow="Isolation boundary" tone="xen" offset="calc(var(--platform-layer-gap) * 0.5)" zIndex={2}>
        <p>Scheduling, isolation, device assignment, and platform control stay visible close to hardware.</p>
      </Layer>

      <Layer title="Hardware platform" eyebrow="Shared compute" tone="hardware" offset="calc(var(--platform-layer-gap) * 1.5)" zIndex={1}>
        <p>Compute, memory, interrupts, peripherals, and SoC integration remain explicit system design inputs.</p>
      </Layer>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="xp-platform-diagram__summary" id="platform-layers-summary">
    Xen separates application workloads, guest domains, hypervisor control, and shared hardware into visible platform layers.
  </p>
</figure>

<style>
  .xp-platform-diagram {
    position: relative;
    min-width: 0;
    margin: 0;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 2.2vw, 1.35rem);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid rgb(198 214 235 / 0.12);
    border-radius: var(--xp-radius-lg);
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 74% 18%, rgb(133 194 65 / 0.16), transparent 32%),
      linear-gradient(145deg, rgb(255 255 255 / 0.03), transparent 38%),
      linear-gradient(180deg, rgb(11 19 32 / 0.82), rgb(5 8 14 / 0.22));
  }

  .xp-platform-diagram::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0.85rem;
    pointer-events: none;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(198 214 235 / 0.055) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(rgb(198 214 235 / 0.045) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 2.75rem 2.75rem;
    mask-image: linear-gradient(130deg, transparent 0%, black 26%, black 70%, transparent 100%);
  }

  .xp-platform-diagram__header {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin: 0 0 clamp(1.35rem, 3vw, 2rem);
  }

  .xp-platform-diagram__eyebrow,
  .xp-platform-diagram__scale {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--xp-accent-primary);
    font-family: var(--xp-font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    line-height: 1.4;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .xp-platform-diagram__scale {
    color: var(--xp-text-muted);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .xp-platform-stack {
    --platform-plate-width: min(32rem, 94%);
    --platform-plate-height: clamp(8.8rem, 17vw, 10.4rem);
    --platform-layer-gap: clamp(6.6rem, 12vw, 8rem);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    min-width: 0;
    min-height: clamp(30rem, 58vw, 39rem);
    align-content: center;
    padding: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.6rem) 0 clamp(2.1rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
  }

  .xp-platform-stack__plates {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    width: var(--platform-plate-width);
    min-width: 0;
    height: var(--platform-plate-height);
    margin-inline: auto;
    translate: clamp(-1.35rem, -2vw, -0.75rem) clamp(0.75rem, 1.8vw, 1.25rem);
    transform-style: preserve-3d;
  }

  .xp-domain-strip {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    max-width: 20rem;
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .xp-domain-strip span {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    min-width: 0;
    color: var(--xp-text-primary);
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    line-height: 1.2;
  }

  .xp-domain-icon {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 1.35rem;
    height: 1.35rem;
    color: rgb(103 217 223 / 0.82);
    flex: 0 0 auto;
  }

  .xp-platform-diagram__summary {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 639px) {
    .xp-platform-diagram {
      padding: 1rem;
      border-radius: var(--xp-radius-md);
    }

    .xp-platform-diagram::before {
      inset: 0.65rem;
      background-size: 2rem 2rem;
      opacity: 0.7;
    }

    .xp-platform-diagram__header {
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    .xp-platform-diagram__scale {
      display: none;
    }

    .xp-platform-stack {
      min-height: auto;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .xp-platform-stack__plates {
      display: grid;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      min-height: auto;
      gap: 0.85rem;
      translate: none;
      transform: none;
    }

    .xp-domain-strip {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media print {
    .xp-platform-diagram {
      border: 1px solid #9ca3af;
      background: transparent;
    }

    .xp-platform-diagram::before {
      display: none;
    }
  }
</style>
